#: deathforth/blurb/sc/evilsanta.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/evilsanta.df"
msgid "I LIKE MILK AND COOKIES"
msgstr "우유랑 쿠키 좋아"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "Zombies sure are flammable."
msgstr "좀비는 참 잘 타."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "Burn it all down!"
msgstr "전부 불태워 버려!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "I burnt my pinky finger on a frying pan once so I wear this suit now."
msgstr "한번은 프라이팬에 새끼손가락을 데여서 그 뒤로 이 옷을 입고 다녀."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "When people get set on fire it's not really MY fault, it's theirs."
msgstr "사람들한테 불이 붙는 건 사실 내 잘못이 아니야. 걔네 잘못이지."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "This suit protects me from fire and also super spicy hot sauce."
msgstr "이 옷은 불도 막아 주고 엄청 매운 핫소스도 막아 줘."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "My favorite strategy is throwing a molotov and then standing in it."
msgstr "내가 제일 좋아하는 전략은 화염병을 던지고 그 안에 서 있는 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid ""
"You can get more mileage out of a blowtorch if you set furniture on fire."
msgstr "가구에 불을 붙이면 토치를 더 알뜰하게 쓸 수 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "I always liked burning things! Now it's just more socially acceptable."
msgstr "난 원래 불 지르는 걸 좋아했어! 이제 사회적으로 좀 더 용인될 뿐이지."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid ""
"If only had easy to purchase flamethrowers before the zombocalypse happened."
msgstr "좀비 종말 전에 화염방사기를 쉽게 살 수 있었다면 좋았을 텐데."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "The flamethrower is the best weapon."
msgstr "화염방사기가 최고의 무기야."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "I like fire axes because they remind me of fire."
msgstr "소방 도끼가 좋아. 불이 생각나거든."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid ""
"If I get enough molotovs, I could take care of the zombies. All of them."
msgstr "화염병만 충분하면 좀비는 내가 처리할 수 있어. 전부 다."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "Is it hot in here or is it just my bulky firesuit?"
msgstr "여기가 더운 거야, 아니면 내 두꺼운 방화복 때문이야?"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "I refuse to take off this suit, ever. A fire can happen at any time."
msgstr "이 옷은 절대 안 벗을 거야. 불은 언제든 날 수 있으니까."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "Gas is the most precious resource, because flamethrowers use gas."
msgstr "기름이 가장 귀한 자원이야. 화염방사기에 기름이 들어가니까."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/fireproof.df"
msgid "I wonder how flammable Canada is."
msgstr "캐나다는 얼마나 잘 탈까."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "pew pew pew pew pew"
msgstr "퓨 퓨 퓨 퓨 퓨"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "I love wearing tights!"
msgstr "난 쫄쫄이 입는 게 좋아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "It's not costumed play! It's costumed business!"
msgstr "이건 코스튬 플레이가 아냐! 코스튬 비즈니스라고!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "If I could find some evil robots to fight, I could steal their powers."
msgstr "사악한 로봇들을 찾아서 싸우면 그 능력을 빼앗을 수 있을 텐데."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "voopvoopvoopvoopvoop BOOM"
msgstr "뷰웅뷰웅뷰웅뷰웅뷰웅 쾅"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "I have a confession: I just make all the blaster noises with my mouth."
msgstr "고백할 게 있어: 블래스터 소리 전부 내 입으로 내는 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "I misplaced my robot dog."
msgstr "로봇 개를 어디 뒀더라."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "Watch out for instant kill spike pits."
msgstr "즉사 가시 구덩이 조심해."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "I can't carry anything because my tights don't have pockets."
msgstr "쫄쫄이에 주머니가 없어서 아무것도 못 들어."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "If this was a robot apocalypse, I'd be king right now."
msgstr "이게 로봇 종말이었으면 지금쯤 내가 왕이었을 텐데."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "No more conventions to videogame cosplay at..."
msgstr "이제 게임 코스프레할 행사도 없네..."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "I made this Giga Guster myself out of felt and some plastic."
msgstr "이 기가 거스터는 펠트랑 플라스틱으로 직접 만든 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "I don't want to stain this costume any more than it is now."
msgstr "이 코스튬을 지금보다 더 더럽히고 싶지 않아."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "Let's find DR DWIGHT so I can finally upgrade my dash."
msgstr "닥터 드와이트를 찾아서 드디어 대시를 업그레이드하자."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "Where the heck is the jump button?"
msgstr "점프 버튼은 대체 어디 있는 거야?"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gigaguy.df"
msgid "I'd feel more at ease if I could find an extra life."
msgstr "1UP을 찾으면 좀 더 마음이 놓일 텐데."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df:3 deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "*PAID ADVERTISEMENT*"
msgstr "*유료 광고*"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "Download PUNCH QUEST on the app store for free, today!!!"
msgstr "오늘 앱스토어에서 PUNCH QUEST를 무료로 다운로드하세요!!!"

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "Try HITTING zombies with a WEAPON."
msgstr "좀비를 무기로 때려 보세요."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "Hushed legends tell of ULTRA HATS, crafted by the gnome gods."
msgstr "노움 신들이 빚어낸 울트라 모자에 관한 전설이 은밀히 전해진다."

#: deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/sc/gnomey.df"
msgid "All life descended from gnomes! Deal with it!"
msgstr "모든 생명은 노움에서 비롯되었다! 받아들여!"
